From: William Macready <william.macready@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 06:29:29 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] test(semantics): verify real buffer reuse and alias
 rejection

Accept retired-slot reuse with R at every boundary; reject live/accumulator overlaps and final/fused intermediate conflicts. Observe unchecked corruption and stuck outcomes, cross-tensor retained output decoding, heterogeneous carriers, unused capacity, and post-write fault snapshots. All three new acceptance modules compile.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
